Third-party components

This repository builds on, and redistributes code derived from, the following
projects. Their original licenses continue to apply to those portions:

  - InstructScene  (https://github.com/chenguolin/InstructScene)
  - ATISS          (https://github.com/nv-tlabs/ATISS)
  - OpenShape      (https://github.com/Colin97/OpenShape_code)

The 3D-FRONT and 3D-FUTURE datasets are not redistributed here and remain
subject to their own terms of use.
